WEBVTT

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:33.580
I've been itching to
see you, Kai Hiwatari.

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:35.810
Who the hell do
you think you are?

00:01:35.810 --> 00:01:37.220
The name's Dunga.

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:39.220
Let's battle, Kai!

00:01:39.220 --> 00:01:41.010
My pleasure, Dunga!

00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:43.200
Go, Shoot!

00:01:57.320 --> 00:02:00.350
Go, Dranzer!!

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:07.510
Kai and Dunga fought an intense battle that should have settled the score for good...

00:02:11.970 --> 00:02:14.470
But members of Team Psykick showed up

00:02:14.470 --> 00:02:17.890
and ended their battle in a draw again.

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:43.540
Goddammit! Goddammit! Goddammit!

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:47.280
If they didn't show up,
I woulda beat Dranzer good!

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:49.800
I hate those freakin' scientists!

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:54.840
What's your problem?

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:57.830
All I'm hearing is you
crying like a lost little baby.

00:02:57.830 --> 00:03:02.010
Put a sock in it! I'm tired
of hearing your excuses.

00:03:02.010 --> 00:03:03.510
You wanna fight, Mariam?!

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:04.750
Dunga, stop.

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:08.710
We shouldn't
fight among ourselves.

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:10.870
But Mariam...!

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:11.770
Dunga!

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:15.710
Where did Yusuf go?

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:17.500
He's tailing them.

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:19.970
Them? You mean the scientists?

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:23.590
Who else would
he be, you moron?

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:26.700
Get down here, Mariam!!

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:03.960
Man does he suck at driving...

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:09.300
Floor 13?

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:07.410
Is that the boss?

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:09.190
He looks cocky as hell...

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:12.960
Pompous bastard.
Makes me sick.

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:15.960
Data entry complete.

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:19.840
Let's give Kai Hiwatari's data a go.

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:23.260
Transfer the control
system to capsule D!

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:24.820
Rotation rate, 500.

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:28.440
Change the center alignment to 99%.

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:33.470
What the--? What
are they starting?

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.070
Do it!

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:45.300
Rotation rate, 150!

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:47.790
250! 370!

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:50.180
Alignment, 59%!

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:51.700
68%!

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:54.560
Rotation rate, 450!

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:57.650
Center alignment, 98%.

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:04.960
Now come on out,
my digital Sacred Beast!

00:06:05.660 --> 00:06:07.310
Digital Sacred Beast?!

00:06:36.230 --> 00:06:37.400
Suzaku!

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:42.080
What's going on?

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:43.540
The Bey is losing control!

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:45.370
This is bad! Shut it down!

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:51.010
Unable to control!

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:53.760
Rotation rate has increased to 1,600!

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:56.840
Center alignment rate is at 140%!

00:07:11.140 --> 00:07:13.650
Why? Why?!

00:07:15.170 --> 00:07:16.340
Step aside!

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:19.140
Son of a...

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:26.860
Oh no, oh no!

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:34.900
--Doctor!
--Doctor, calm down!

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:36.100
Unhand me!

00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:38.730
--Why?! Why?!
--Doctor, please!

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:40.580
Don't touch me!

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:41.460
Move!

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:42.490
Doctor!

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:46.430
Is that their game?

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:51.230
A digital Sacred Beast?

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:54.400
First their capture systems,
and now digital Sacred Beasts...

00:07:54.710 --> 00:07:56.920
It sounds like
something they'd cook up.

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:59.460
What do we do, Ozma?

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:04.150
If they get their hands on the
four Sacred Beasts, our plan is toast!

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:08.460
Don't worry. The digital Sacred
Beasts are still in development.

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:12.560
Do you even care?!
What if they complete them?!

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:16.920
The four Sacred Beasts
can't beat the digital ones!

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:19.380
Ahh, ingorance is bliss.

00:08:19.380 --> 00:08:21.320
I wish I was like you.

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:23.560
What now, Mariam?!

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:28.130
I guess we're going to have to
force the Sacred Beasts to improve.

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:29.100
Yeah.

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:30.170
Sis!

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:32.320
Should we do it?

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:42.240
Are you serious?

00:08:42.240 --> 00:08:48.620
Yes. I just got word from the
BBA China and BBA America branches.

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:53.270
The Bladers with the invisible
Sacred Beasts you two are looking for

00:08:53.270 --> 00:08:55.410
are here in Japan.

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:57.020
They're in Japan?!

00:08:57.300 --> 00:09:01.210
They've even been
spotted in this very town.

00:09:01.210 --> 00:09:02.630
Really?!

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:05.410
Even Dunga went after Kai.

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:07.570
It isn't impossible.

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:09.260
Time for revenge.

00:09:09.260 --> 00:09:10.170
Mhmm!

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:14.420
If we find them, we might
find where Ozma is, too!

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:17.480
Okay! Let's all search
for them together!

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:18.560
--Yeah!
--Yeah!

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:19.570
Wait!

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:22.050
Did you forget about yesterday?

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:26.120
Those Team Psykick
guys haven't given up!

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:29.370
We don't know what kinds
of cheap tricks they'll use next!

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:33.410
Either way, you should
lay low for now.

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:36.720
Do you mean we
should just sit and wait?

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:39.330
They might be so close to us, too!

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:40.900
I can't just sit still.

00:09:40.900 --> 00:09:41.890
He's right!

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:44.930
I understand how you boys feel.

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:49.460
But seeing as we currently have
no information on Team Psykick,

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:53.170
we don't know what
will happen to you.

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:59.570
The BBA will take care of finding the
four Bladers with the invisible Sacred Beasts.

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:02.220
So I request that
you do as Hiromi says...

00:10:02.220 --> 00:10:03.770
Even so, we--

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:04.660
Yes, sir.

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:05.790
Kyoujyu!

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:08.650
The Chairman is going so far for us.

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:11.200
Let's leave this to the BBA.

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:12.420
Right.

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:14.560
We're counting on you, Chairman.

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:16.510
You have my word.

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:17.620
Takao?

00:10:18.190 --> 00:10:20.100
Sure. Whatever.

00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:22.440
If that's that, then
it's time for practice!

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:25.890
You gotta practice
and get even better!

00:10:31.220 --> 00:10:35.010
Let's start with a match
between Takao and Rei.

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:36.940
Let's do it, Rei.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:38.380
I'm not holding back.

00:10:38.380 --> 00:10:40.030
Be my guest!

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:42.690
Three! Two! One!

00:10:42.690 --> 00:10:44.670
Go, Shoot!

00:10:44.670 --> 00:10:45.740
Shoot!

00:10:50.260 --> 00:10:52.800
Yes! That's it, Dragoon!

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:54.980
Keep up the attack!

00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:01.300
These two are so into it.

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:05.740
You've got a visitor.

00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:06.590
For me?

00:11:06.590 --> 00:11:10.080
Max, you're a
smooth operator!

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:12.790
You sly dog, you.

00:11:15.780 --> 00:11:18.660
What? No one's here.

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:22.780
Scared of a couple of scientists?

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:25.620
Some world champ you are!

00:11:25.820 --> 00:11:27.600
Who's there? Come on out!

00:11:33.530 --> 00:11:36.080
Hi. It's been a little while.

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:38.530
I remember you!

00:11:42.480 --> 00:11:44.380
Hey, you're Max, right?

00:11:44.380 --> 00:11:47.790
Okay, here we go. Go, Shoot!

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:56.510
No way!

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:01.620
I've been looking for you!

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:05.810
Oh my, is that what they
call love at first sight?

00:12:05.810 --> 00:12:08.050
Mariam's a little flattered.

00:12:08.050 --> 00:12:10.440
Mariam... is that your name?

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:13.400
Yup. Great name isn't it?

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:15.530
That was a nice rouse.

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:18.420
I never thought you'd
use a Sacred Beast.

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:21.120
That was just my
way of saying hello.

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:23.680
But boy, the look on
your face back then.

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:27.810
Just thinking about
it makes me laugh!

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:30.770
It won't happen again!

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:32.450
Come on! Get down here!

00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:37.020
Wait!

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:46.990
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:53.330
Go Dragoon!

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:54.930
Driger, don't lose!

00:12:59.010 --> 00:13:00.690
Not bad, Rei.

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:02.020
You too.

00:13:02.020 --> 00:13:04.330
Alright. Next! Max!

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:12.190
Really, grandpa?

00:13:12.190 --> 00:13:13.080
Mhmm.

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:15.480
Why didn't you tell us?

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:18.800
She said she was a fan of Max's, so I...

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:20.140
God, I swear...

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:24.240
Someone going out of their way
to see Max sounds suspicious...

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:25.570
I agree.

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:28.100
Okay. Let's split
and search for Max.

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:29.420
Let's!

00:13:34.590 --> 00:13:37.770
She should be
around here somewhere...

00:13:47.730 --> 00:13:49.290
You're late.

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:54.880
Oh, that's it.

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:56.320
Is this what you wanted?

00:13:56.320 --> 00:13:57.490
Okay.

00:13:57.730 --> 00:13:59.300
Just what I wanted.

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:02.550
I won't lose this time!

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:04.930
I'll be the judge of that.

00:14:08.420 --> 00:14:10.980
Mariam's just showing off.

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:13.280
She wants to test his skills first?

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:16.260
Come on. I'm ready when you are.

00:14:16.260 --> 00:14:19.240
I'll show you the power of Draciel!

00:14:19.240 --> 00:14:21.790
Three, two, one!

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:23.280
Go, Shoot!

00:14:23.280 --> 00:14:24.260
Shoot!

00:14:27.520 --> 00:14:28.580
She dodged it!

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:30.660
You need better aim.

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:35.310
Darn, she's slippery!

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:37.980
It's my turn!

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:40.190
Sharcrash!

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:47.810
You've improved a little.

00:14:47.810 --> 00:14:48.790
What?!

00:14:48.790 --> 00:14:50.290
This is the end!

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:52.120
Sharcrash!

00:14:58.220 --> 00:15:01.070
Is that her Sacred Beast?

00:15:01.070 --> 00:15:02.420
Then so will I!

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:04.360
Draciel!

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:11.450
There it is.

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:12.510
Genbu.

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:13.770
It's been a long
time coming.

00:15:14.070 --> 00:15:16.010
Go, Draciel!

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:27.920
Draciel, you gotta hang in there!

00:15:28.710 --> 00:15:31.000
He withstood it!

00:15:33.260 --> 00:15:36.560
Time to ramp it up
to full speed, Draciel!

00:15:40.090 --> 00:15:42.340
What are you doing?

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:47.410
Mariam talks big but she's
getting a run for her money.

00:15:47.410 --> 00:15:49.140
Guess it's my turn.

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:52.860
Vanishing Moot!

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:57.050
Draciel!

00:15:57.380 --> 00:15:58.450
Who's there?!

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:00.530
Yusuf...

00:16:00.530 --> 00:16:01.890
This ain't like you, sis.

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:04.160
I just underestimated him.

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:06.780
Who are you? You cheat!

00:16:06.780 --> 00:16:09.680
Yusuf. Ask Rei for the details.

00:16:09.680 --> 00:16:11.700
You beat Rei, then?

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:15.640
Vanishing Moot!

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:23.570
Sharcrash!

00:16:34.630 --> 00:16:35.870
Genbu!

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:44.680
What's that?

00:16:56.290 --> 00:17:00.150
What's the matter? Can't push back?

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:02.290
Darn it...

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:04.050
Resist, Max.

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:08.160
The more you do, Genbu will grow.

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:18.210
Let's wrap things up for today.

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:21.100
Over already? Boring.

00:17:21.280 --> 00:17:22.770
Oh well.

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:24.400
Abyss Spear!

00:17:32.840 --> 00:17:33.910
Rei!

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:36.730
I've been looking for you.

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:38.550
Sorry about that.

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:41.350
Glad to see you're in good shape.

00:17:41.350 --> 00:17:45.650
Wouldn't you say two against one is pretty low?

00:17:45.650 --> 00:17:49.910
If you're a real Blader, you
should fight fair and square.

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:54.600
Is a "real" Blader one
who just does it for kicks?

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:55.650
What?

00:17:57.330 --> 00:18:00.580
I won't forgive anyone who
makes a mockery of Bladers.

00:18:00.580 --> 00:18:02.100
Perpare yourself.

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:04.260
I'm getting my payback for last time.

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:06.840
If you really wanna
lose that badly...

00:18:06.840 --> 00:18:08.150
I see.

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:10.310
Is that how you
handle yourselves?

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:13.080
I'm in.

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:15.300
This is getting good.

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:18.340
Driger! Go, Shoot!

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:20.070
Draciel, Shoot!

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:21.590
--Shoot!

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:23.900
Sharcrash!

00:18:23.900 --> 00:18:25.930
Vanishing Moot!

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:35.150
Genbu!

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.320
Byakko!

00:18:47.610 --> 00:18:48.920
--Go!

00:18:58.020 --> 00:18:59.470
You're first.

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:00.660
Abyss Spear!

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:02.640
Vanishing Moot!

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:07.240
Darn...

00:19:07.430 --> 00:19:08.370
Driger!

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:11.810
Here we go.

00:19:13.440 --> 00:19:14.890
O-oh no!

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:20.650
You're next!

00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:31.280
Shoot...

00:19:33.530 --> 00:19:35.600
Go, Draciel!

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:40.200
You don't learn!

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:45.890
Rei!

00:19:46.100 --> 00:19:47.200
I'm okay!

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:50.370
But stay close or
they'll pick us off!

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:51.390
Got it.

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:55.200
That won't work.

00:19:55.200 --> 00:19:56.210
Sis.

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:58.750
Sharcrash!

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:04.650
No way!

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:07.650
We're on a whole 'nother level.

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:32.300
What power!

00:20:32.300 --> 00:20:33.380
Darn it!

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:39.090
We'll show you how
powerful our Sacred Beasts are!

00:21:06.890 --> 00:21:08.530
That was boring.

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:11.060
We're going to
need a lot more time.

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:12.360
Let's go, Dunga.

00:21:12.360 --> 00:21:13.140
Yeah.

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:14.770
Ozma!!

00:21:17.660 --> 00:21:19.600
I finally found you!

00:22:59.080 --> 00:23:01.780
Takao and Ozma's battle has finally begun.

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:05.180
After the battle, what is the meaning of the mysterous words Ozma left us?

00:23:05.180 --> 00:23:09.270
And just what kind of monster is Psykick's digital Sacred Beast?

00:23:09.270 --> 00:23:13.680
What is it, Chairman?
"I've been on a Beyblade diet recently"?

00:23:13.680 --> 00:23:15.510
You haven't changed at all!

00:23:15.510 --> 00:23:18.080
And you weren't listening at all, were you?

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:20.980
Don't miss the next episode, Chairman!
